WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Now for step 4, the key geometric construction shown in figure 3.

00:05.340 --> 00:09.780
We draw a new line straight down from corner G, parallel to the curve,

00:10.020 --> 00:14.280
until it meets the horizontal line f to x at a new point, k.

00:14.860 --> 00:18.840
In step 5, notice that the distance f to k at the bottom

00:18.840 --> 00:22.260
is equal to the width w of the parked car at the top.

00:22.820 --> 00:25.500
Since we already know the full length f to x,

00:25.500 --> 00:29.980
the remaining segment k to x is simply f to x minus w.

